Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:07:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 100/260] [ae-patch] List the notes saved on the session in the
 rail's Triage card, so an old Absorbed or Unfiled note stays readable

The card counted Absorbed: and UNFILED lines from the ae.absorbed and ae.unfiled
labels but found their text only in the messages the chat had loaded, so a note
in an older message showed as "The lines are in older messages not loaded here."
The AE observer now saves each counted line as a label of its own (ae.absorbed.1
and on). The card lists those notes first, in order, then any loaded line not
saved yet (one counted before notes were saved, or past the observer's cap of 20),
each loaded line matched against the saved notes once. A loaded line is cut the
way the observer's Python cuts it (code points, Python's whitespace), so a saved
note and its loaded line always match. AE files only.
